# Sweep Along Path round a closed path: a square swept round a circle,
# picked with the mouse, back to where it started, with no caps; the
# group screen, then the solid checked.
file $testdata/ui/sweep_ring.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view other
click-entity 40000
menu Features|Sweep Along Path
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
